# A common finite factorization of an algebra

Two finite algebra factorizations, one of whose induced maps on spectra is an open immersion, are
dominated by a third such factorization: the subalgebra that works is the join of the two images.

The mathematics lives in
`StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.Different.DualizingModulesQuasi.CommonFactorization`, which this
module re-exports: `Stacks.Discriminant.exists_finite_subalgebra_dominating`, carrying
`@[stacks 0BT0]`.

